Sure. I need a few details:

- day and time, and how long;
- who should attend — all five TAs (Sarah, John, Priya, Diego, Hana), or a subset;
- anything to put in the invitation.

If you'd rather leave the slot to me: from what I know of next week, Tue 11:00-11:30, Wed 10:00-10:30 or Wed 13:00-13:30 are free on your calendar, and Diego's TA duties don't collide with any of those. Tell me which and I'll book it and write to the TAs.
